As a low-level character I've often used the teleport-if-you're-too-stupid-
to-read-the-spellbook "feature" to get myself out of sticky situations. There
is then a 50/50 chance that I'll be killed anyway, because of the paralysis.
I think this penalty is important though, to prevent abuse. Obviously as a
high level character you want to make sure you have teleport control if you're
going to fool around with arcane magic...

